# Advertising Advertising
#
# Rule format: HOST-SUFFIX,domain,REJECT
# HOST-SUFFIX matches the domain and all its subdomains.
#
# Quantumult X example:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lonecoding/QuantumultX-Rules/main/rules/Advertising/Advertising.list, tag=Advertising, update-interval=86400, enabled=true
#
# Advertising domains change over time. If an app or site fails, disable this list temporarily
# and add a DIRECT exception for false positives. No subscriptions, servers, or tokens are included.
# Last updated: 2026-09-03
# --- Google advertising ---
HOST-SUFFIX,doubleclick.net,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googlesyndication.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googleadservices.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googletagservices.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,2mdn.net,REJECT
# --- Microsoft / Yahoo / AOL advertising ---
HOST-SUFFIX,ads.microsoft.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,adnxs.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,advertising.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,atwola.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,gemini.yahoo.com,REJECT
# --- Amazon advertising ---
HOST-SUFFIX,amazon-adsystem.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,aaxads.com,REJECT
